<title>POLAND: Investors take 6.2 mln shrs in Polish Strzelec IPO.</title>
<headline>Investors take 6.2 mln shrs in Polish Strzelec IPO.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	     Brewer Malopolski Browar Strzelec SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue:    new common shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:     6.2 million to 8.2 million</p>
<p>Total No of Shares Subscribed:  6.2 million</p>
<p> Price (PLN)	 2.3</p>
<p>TRANCHES	   NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES</p>
<p>		     SUBSCRIBED</p>
<p>OFFERED</p>
<p>Large investors    330,046	2.6 million</p>
<p>Small investors  2,357,933	5.6 million</p>
<p>Guarantors:</p>
<p> Bank Handlowy   1,190,794</p>
<p>PBR  1,157,637</p>
<p> Bank PKO BP     1,163,590</p>
<p>NOTE: Strzelec seeks a parallel-market listing in late September.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
